            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:41:09.805487+00:00",
            "notes": "I've found the best builds with Brig tend to be the ones that have more survivability. Which is why the first power I always pick is Optimizer.\n\n[Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) provides incredible survivability in the early game as it provides you healing of 5% of your max life every 1 second for each repair pack active. \n\nFor items I will always pick:\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n\nThe third item I pick in round one will depend on the heroes the other team has:\n- [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) - I will normally pick this if they are running a longer range comp like Pharah, Soldier and Ashe.\n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) - If they are playing dive characters like D.va or Reaper I will normally go with some lifesteal to improve my survivability when they dive.",
