        {
            "id": "f0802078-f3ba-4fa8-984e-5f306f2d9354",
            "build_id": "4ee8f038-7bf0-4d2c-8c48-baf90fe24ce8",
            "round_number": 2,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:41:10.055858+00:00",
            "notes": "For Round 2, my focus is on cooldown reduction to increase the uptime on my repair packs as well as be able to trigger inspire more often with whip shot from a distance. \n\nThe main items for round 2 are:\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n\nIf I have extra money I will normally go with [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for additional AP, which increases your repair pack healing. \n\nRemember, Brig is NOT a tank. You shouldn't be trying to face tank as Brig. I play her from distance, as close to being with my team as possible to get healing through inspire and focus on keeping repair packs up on my team. \n\nIt's especially important to focus on getting your repair packs to your teammates that are diving as you don't want to be right in there with them so they won't be within range for inspire.",
